abstract: >-
  Slides of a 30-minute talk for researchers in the DIVERSA project on
  reproducible data science: organising projects and documenting data,
  tracking changes with git and GitHub, recording the software environment,
  automating processing as a pipeline, and publishing code and data with a
  licence and DOI.
